review Crytek Sponza in metres with Pestana's PBR textures. The world-cache texel is 0.125 m. Look down the atrium, along the colonnade, at the curtains, and into the dark corner. Curtain and chain alpha is opaque; only the thorn and the vase plant discard. There is no specular lobe.
